jfk_ask_not.wav — public domain.

Four-second excerpt of John F. Kennedy's inaugural address (1961-01-20), a United States
government work with no copyright. Resampled to 16 kHz mono PCM16 from whisper.cpp's
canonical samples/jfk.wav test fixture. Used as the speech fixture for the voice-activity
tutorial and any test needing a few seconds of real speech with zero downloads.
